<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to make provision for the merger of banks,
and for other purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_83bf940c-c0cc-4c6e-b2cc-0d0822eba846"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading id="sec.1-he"
guid="_6eaa3e33-6872-4dd6-a1a2-ec19df12baa1"><b>Name of
Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
refid="act-1996-130" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Bank Mergers Act
1996</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d27b6d10-b583-4105-90b7-52e9fa3ede7b"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading id="sec.2-he"
guid="_48625fbf-08cb-4389-8a0c-81be8fcf7eca"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on the date of
assent.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_37926e34-41aa-453d-9898-b5334669db17"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading id="sec.3-he"
guid="_0229a1e0-817f-4e81-bac2-fe8a05868fbb"><b>Object</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9fc9d954-a606-4c9e-9c88-92e92095d6be"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to facilitate the
merger of 2 or more banks and to enable regulations to be made for that
purpose.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9c4578b3-c56f-42d8-842d-c30942f543f6"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this Act, a merger includes
any transaction by which a bank acquires another bank, either by the transfer
of the whole or part of the undertaking of the other bank, or by becoming the
successor in law of the other bank, or by other means.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8ddbe2e3-c635-4409-b175-b924ade4f16e"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading id="sec.4-he"
guid="_c74bd71d-5c6f-41bb-8571-7080b5a805d5"><b>Regulations for the merging of
banks</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce8af7ec-53c8-4270-9ce2-67499b273ed5"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may make provision for or
relating to the merger of 2 or more banks.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4906518b-a44f-4f39-b352-4b1833e5f476"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), the regulations
may make provision for or with respect to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a" guid="_f30b321d-d1fc-4225-8cb6-6ba55017a590"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transfer of the whole or part of the
undertaking of a bank to another bank and the vesting of the whole or part of
that undertaking in the other bank,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b" guid="_f068fd48-d9bf-4749-97e4-1e75b2fe6baa"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the succession of one bank as the successor in
law of another bank and the effect of that succession, including the vesting
of assets or liabilities,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.c" guid="_e868f0d0-178e-4b8e-ad71-900838c028d9"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the obligations of the banks concerned in
relation to the merger and related transactions,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.d" guid="_2fadeadb-07a2-40d9-ba22-1212f47a00a2"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on existing contracts,
agreements (oral or written), deeds, leases, licences and other instruments
and other undertakings of a bank that is being merged with another
bank,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.e" guid="_208ccb17-ad61-4186-ac8b-3a0a05d40f79"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the relationship of a bank with the customers or
depositors of another bank concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.f" guid="_23a6ae70-ce12-4393-ac6d-e06931846729"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on custody or bailment
of documents, goods or things held by the banks concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.g" guid="_b575e97d-9602-4bbc-83d6-2343485605f4"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on existing securities
of a bank that is being merged with another bank,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.h" guid="_5316f4d6-4536-4767-8e07-67e544915e66"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on the employment,
superannuation and related rights of staff of a bank that is being merged with
another bank,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.i" guid="_44a30f05-88cb-442c-bf59-5fc0f2adbc4e"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the use of business names by the banks
concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.j" guid="_dc22b8a4-68c8-437f-8a8d-4100e0adc494"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(j)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on existing or pending
legal proceedings and evidence in existing or future legal proceedings, and on
legal rights and obligations,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.k" guid="_755e4b26-6615-4817-9456-35f3b9dce01e"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(k)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the effect of the merger on the liabilities of
the banks concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.l" guid="_b679dc85-88cd-4a8b-9ba9-a9dedd17d171"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(l)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the construction of references to the banks
concerned and any other persons or bodies affected by the
merger,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.m" guid="_fa68cd45-84cd-485f-b222-1fdd8edd00d8"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(m)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">service of documents on the banks
concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.n" guid="_14e681f0-c927-4ad3-bea0-523ebc0d74a2"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(n)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transfer of assets or liabilities of a bank
that is being merged with another bank and the recognition of the transfer by
the Registrar-General or any other person or authority,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.o" guid="_fa9df97c-2690-45a8-9342-97f5ae1881ca"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(o)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the identification of assets or liabilities of a
bank that is being merged with another bank,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.p" guid="_05a22954-7130-45ca-8266-ba3dd78d8173"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(p)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transfer of charges, and compliance with
related statutory requirements, as a consequence of the
merger,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.q" guid="_5131ff00-d37c-4e42-99b4-42d10750317e"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(q)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">evidence of matters related to the
merger,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.r" guid="_08c0ce52-17cc-480b-a9f6-4d6955506334"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(r)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">payment, or exemption from payment, of duties,
taxes, charges, rates or other imposts,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.s" guid="_719f20fe-4c24-4654-a62f-bb3db8eba1c5"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(s)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">other provisions of a savings or transitional
nature consequential on the merger.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1f86efaa-92c7-4788-8837-c205c41c0841"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation made for the purposes of this
section may be expressed to have effect despite the provisions of any other
Act relating to the payment of duties, taxes, charges, rates or other imposts
or to the registration of ownership of assets or liabilities and, if so
expressed, has effect accordingly.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f846fa40-b433-43d8-ad9f-5c2e24924a45"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading id="sec.5-he"
guid="_042d22f0-ffbf-4d06-8d37-ef8c110d93ea"><b>Succession of
banks</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3df46347-fe79-48f1-a315-59d84d34c097"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation for the purposes of this Act may
provide for the liquidation or dissolution of a bank being merged with another
bank.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6b6ef0b3-51e3-4005-8e7a-2309a099ad95"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such regulation may only be made with the
approval of the Minister administering the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
refid="sl-1999-0703" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations
Law</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_57f2c9b5-c295-4ecf-927c-e7e4eec35e15"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation for the purposes of this Act may
provide that a bank is the successor in law of another bank and is, for all
purposes, a continuation of and the same legal entity as the other
bank.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_db5f2a89-7025-43d5-80ef-34714eaf46b3"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading id="sec.6-he"
guid="_30e8e5a6-16b2-43d0-ac38-281594bebfc2"><b>Regulations
generally</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a1a2dec7-b785-4bd0-8331-3ed21525e9a6"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading id="sec.7-he"
guid="_cccad906-27d6-40b2-b5e0-1851076b8897"><b>Extra-territorial
operation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is the intention of Parliament that a
regulation relating to the merger of 2 or more banks under this Act should
apply, as far as possible, (and except in so far as the regulation otherwise
provides) to the following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.7-para1.a" guid="_8779d0f3-2f29-4bd2-a660-1453a9cf4bfe"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">land situated outside New South Wales, whether in
or outside Australia,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.b" guid="_57a5887c-ba00-4942-b75d-b45a9fa8a0d5"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">things situated outside New South Wales, whether
in or outside Australia,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.c" guid="_e1254bc8-98ad-4883-9acf-f4bd2b84c5ea"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">acts, transactions and matters done, entered into
or occurring outside New South Wales, whether in or outside
Australia,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.d" guid="_02e3f1c3-f708-46d3-867d-e311ebed97fb"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">things, acts, transactions and matters (whether
situated, done, entered into or occurring) that would, apart from this Act, be
governed or otherwise affected by the law of a foreign
country.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5007f1e1-9ab4-46a6-8237-ddb733ac4078"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading id="sec.8-he"
guid="_e8e7d0c7-ff83-4fca-9a98-984fb22098ce"><b>Act binds
Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of Parliament permits, the Crown
in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


